# DN-43, review on PR 272: the About sheet over Settings (Super+,). Down, Down, Right and Enter go to the sheet:
# no Settings page moves while it is up, Enter closes it, and Esc then closes Settings.
hdesk: screen 1920x1080 plane 1920x
=hdesk: settings 1
hdesk: app menu open
~hdesk: app menu chose [0-9]+ \|About .+\|
=hdesk: about 1
-hdesk: settings
=hdesk: about closed
-hdesk: settings page
=hdesk: settings closed
=hdesk: shell ended, status 0
